===== message-broker-transport =====
probe-kind: tcp-connect
endpoint: localhost:61616
purpose: the wire the application publishes and consumes messages on, as opposed to the management surface above
connect-timeout-seconds: 10
bytes-sent: 0
credential-sent: none
observed-outcome: CONNECTED
what-this-does-and-does-not-establish: a completed connection proves the
  port accepts connections.  It does NOT establish that the service behind
  it is healthy, that it speaks the protocol expected of it, or that this
  application can authenticate to it.  Those are observed, where they are
  observed at all, by the flows that use the service.

